---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
List the snapshot files with their request, name and state (ok, orphaned or unreferenced name)

Usage: rustman snapshot list [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]
          A folder or request file to limit the listing to (default: the whole workspace)

Options:
      --json
          Print a JSON array instead of one line per snapshot

      --workspace <DIR>
          Workspace directory (default: search from the current directory upwards)

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
